{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The inhabitants of a gloomy fishing village built on the site of a forgotten ancient temple are forced to fight their nightmares every night. Explore the village and uncover its secrets. But to do this, you will have to help the locals in their difficult battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570260/extras/620.gif?t=1742287580\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FIGHT TO GET OUT OF THE NIGHTMARE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the tower master with special weapons! Combine the dropped cards and destroy the hordes of enemies in your nightmares! After each dream, you will learn new information!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COLLECT UNIQUE LOOT\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Randomly dropped items will help you better combine tower defenses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER THE SECRETS OF EVERY VILLAGER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character has their own secrets. Meet the fisherman and carpenter, the captain of the ship and many others!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570260?t=1742287580","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570260/69097a3f22438ad460ea9dd5c46b64815c8b7867/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742287580","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570260/5b8e6be7fb8d4ac5ace7a9e9fb6058b357affc90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742287580","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570260/5b8e6be7fb8d4ac5ace7a9e9fb6058b357affc90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742287580","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The inhabitants of a gloomy fishing village built on the site of 